      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BETTOR BEACH (2) went through the Vicbred Super Series undefeated, taking advantage of the ace draw to cruise home by 13m in the final here last start. First try at this longer distance but she has the speed to go forward from another good draw. That should see her hard to catch. THE QUEENS GAMBIT NZ (8) suffered her first defeat in Australia when she placed behind a star colt last start. Had looked good in easy wins at Menangle and Bathurst prior. Draws to trail the top pick and she has the talent to challenge. KEAYANG PASSION (6) has placed in all four starts this time in including the Vicbred Final when third to BETTOR BEACH. Came from a similar draw to this for second to a smart filly last start. Can be in the finish again. Looks a gap to the rest with RACHELS LEGACY (4) next in line.",
